msgctxt "Training Status field description"
msgid ""
"This contact is currently on hold. It has potential of getting scheduled in "
"the future."
msgstr ""
"Ta stik je trenutno na čakanju. Obstaja možnost, da bo v prihodnosti "
"načrtovan."

